findings.text:
The quality agreement sets a 95% on-time target and a EUR 150 flat fee per supplier-caused complaint. The supplier misses both badly:
- on time is 76% against requested dates (84% against its own confirmed dates), with a peer median of 84.6%;
- quality is 762 ppm against a peer median of 457 ppm;
- there were 6 complaints on 330030, EUR 600 recharged, and 2 8D reports still open.
The chargeback is low compared with the damage.
